          </table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellCenter">
            <text:p>寄附者区分【　法人　・　個人　】　（※いずれかを○で囲んでください。）</text:p>
